      "created_at": "2012-04-19T00:10:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Indeed. I know in my area the positive word-of-mouth has really pushed the game. A friend discovered it at PAXEast, brought it back and told a bunch of our friends, I played it and pushed it on a bunch of my friends, who have gone to push it onto their friends!  We’ve even been talking it up to customers at the local game store, so now they carry it.  I think the fact that it’s really just 3 guys behind the game makes people want to see it succeed.  That and it’s so frackin’ fun!</p>",
